# "As this land enters, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters tapped": Bot1 accepts, loses 2 life (18) and the Stomping Ground enters untapped, tapping for {R} at once to cast Lightning Bolt (the payment for the red; the declined case is the existing scenario).

[Bot1 Deck]
Stomping Ground
Lightning Bolt
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Stomping Ground.Play
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Battlefield.Stomping Ground.Activate(Ability: {R})
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield.Stomping Ground.Tapped = true
